  "description": "A lightweight, restartable debounce timer for .NET. Designed for deterministic settlement in UI and event-driven workflows. Avoids TaskCanceledException by design and supports awaitable epochs for structured async coordination.",
  "id": "IVSoftware.Portable.WatchdogTimer",
